<https://github.com/john1hsu/business-knowledge-graph/id/disruptive-innovation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clayton Christensen's theory that resource-poor entrants can topple established firms by starting with products that are worse on mainstream performance measures but cheaper, simpler or more convenient, winning overlooked or non-consuming customers and then moving upmarket." .
