<https://github.com/john1hsu/business-knowledge-graph/id/dividend-policy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A firm's choices about how much of its earnings to return to shareholders, in what form (cash dividends or share repurchases) and on what schedule, as opposed to retaining the cash for reinvestment; Miller and Modigliani showed it is irrelevant to value in frictionless markets, so real-world payout behaviour is explained by taxes, information and agency problems." .
