<https://github.com/john1hsu/business-knowledge-graph/id/dupont-analysis> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A ratio-analysis framework that breaks return on equity into profit margin, total asset turnover and the equity multiplier, showing whether a firm's returns come from operating efficiency, asset usage or financial leverage; it descends from the return-on-investment formula Donaldson Brown built at DuPont in 1914." .
