<https://github.com/john1hsu/business-knowledge-graph/id/dynamic-capabilities> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A strategy theory holding that durable competitive advantage in fast-changing markets comes from a firm's ability to integrate, build and reconfigure its resources and competences, usually described as sensing opportunities, seizing them and transforming the organization." .
