<https://github.com/john1hsu/business-knowledge-graph/id/moral-hazard> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The tendency of a party who is insured, paid or otherwise protected against the consequences of its actions to take less care or more risk than it would if it bore the full cost, because the other party cannot observe or contract on those actions; it is managed with cost sharing, monitoring and incentive pay rather than eliminated." .
